{"id":"steam-1386720","steam":1386720,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Domynyo","summary":"Post-apocalyptic and Abandonment are the protagonists of the 1st Season.\r\nDark locations and abandoned places in a 4k world.\r\nThe day-night cycle and climate conditions will influence the game to the point that you could find yourself in the dark seeking for a torch and praying for the storm to end.","about":"Domynyo is a multiplayer online game based on a variety of playable modalities.\r\nWe aim to present a realistic graphics and fascinating gameplay based on fictional and visionary (fully customizable) vehicles, items, accessories and weapons.\r\n\r\nLet’s talk about the game! Domynyo is playable both in First Person and Third Person, depending on players preferences. Domynyo is NOT a pay to win. The player will be able to purchase in-game content but that won’t give any sort of advantages, it will just make your character look more pretty (if you have good taste)!\r\n\r\nMAIN THEMES AND LOOK?\r\n\r\nPost-apocalyptic and Abandoned\r\nenvironments are the protagonists of the First Season.\r\nDark environments, debris, creepy locations in a 4k world.\r\n\r\nWe thought dynamic lightning and weather is a must! The day-night cycle and climate conditions will influence the game to the point that you could find yourself in the dark seeking for a torch and praying for the storm to end (while trying not to get shot)!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386720/library_600x900.jpg?t=1768587639","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386720/header.jpg?t=1768587639","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386720/library_hero.jpg?t=1768587639","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386720/header.jpg?t=1768587639","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap